#. module: pb_hr_payroll_formula
#: model:res.groups,comment:pb_hr_payroll_formula.group_formula_user
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Can view formula configurations and use them for payroll calculation.\n"
"                Cannot create or modify configurations.\n"
"            "
